    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72fff5cddd9d928933d1ea6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到波旁同学和米浴同学\r\n每天努力的模样，令我十分欣慰！\r\n两位都是一百分！满分！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d30b0c23746e13f839c18ee1fdd522abca1608dd1bcc82a070d5d6c95ff668cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1041/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04e8e6b2de61af174bfc1e2b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……训练员您也说些什么吧！\r\n我被这样默默盯着看……\r\n就会觉得浑身不自在啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fb77af3ab90a7e23c8bc435a26c08973bb0fa94f3ab178b9dd87a1d6382c934",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1041/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7808612a06bd2b4e1eddf0b4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，我就是完美的！\r\n看我一分钟之内跳完\r\n三分钟的舞步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f54708a9f72e746824715e747f1af9310bcf13f1df3bfe99bb474ccc7bc864",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1041/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c8cd0fbdf52d0c810ef034",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我暂时就穿这样过日子吧！\r\n因为这衣服很难脱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "611026280f1ebaa879921c69a074e4ea99bf7fa7bef693edd6098b1d528eddbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1041/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1251e0dcabdda35ecfea40b1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不会辜负大家对我的期望，\r\n我们一起努力，让大家看到\r\n我盛开成最耀眼、最大朵的樱花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2e1a49efe5715faabd0b7a4cc9be98a95fc64392aa8dcfbacd97037c55e3208",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1041/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd65b2f63c2dd5620d95855",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会在各种比赛中拿下胜利给您看！\r\n这才是班长该有的样子！没错！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e30e060b3f610bf35a3c88b1a26f272024de62c0e0bbc68646f134b5a541f077",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
